    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105559" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόφ-ιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>aliment, maintenance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				5349
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>diet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.415
			</span></i>: as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδάφη τ.</span>
			<i>pastures</i> for the Hathor-cow, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1216.113
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>circular pad</i> to prevent sores, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).457
			</span></i>.</div>
